{"availability":"available","full":"cbrauckmuller/helium","name":"helium","description":"A responsive frontend framework that won't weigh you down.","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":975,"forks":59,"created":"2012-11-20T15:16:37Z","updated":"2017-04-17T08:53:13Z","branch":"master","homepage":"https://fundrise.com","topics":[],"demo":null,"color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T21:19:27.833Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T21:19:27.833Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-03T21:19:27.833Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T21:19:27.833Z","stars":975,"forks":59}],"technologies":[],"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T09:39:23.492Z","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Helium is a frontend responsive web framework for rapid prototyping and production-ready development using HTML5 and CSS3. In many ways it is similar to both Twitter Bootstrap and ZURB Foundation - in fact, it uses bits of their code. Unlike either of these two frameworks, however, Helium is designed to be much more lightweight and easier to tinker with. Think of it as a classic car where you can pop open the hood and easily work on the engine. The compiled default CSS file weighs in at a comparatively tiny 30k, versus approximately 100k for Bootstrap and almost 200k for Foundation."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cbrauckmuller/helium/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"fe49e063334f40cd5b3acd086f22a02a3025cc4b739d7170a3c620f306046c09","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T06:15:36.931Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T09:39:23.490Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2017-04-17T08:53:13Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Helium is a frontend responsive web framework for rapid prototyping and production-ready development using HTML5 and CSS3. In many ways it is similar to both Twitter Bootstrap and ZURB Foundation - in fact, it uses bits of their code. Unlike either of these two frameworks, however, Helium is designed to be much more lightweight